## Section

## RULES

```elixir
rules=
"""
cmd cmdA { do this } node01;
cmd cmdB { do that } node02;

cmd cmdC { turn that on && turn that off } low, node02;
cmd cmdD { turn that off && clean files } node02;
"""
# IO.puts(rules)
#   ExMan.loadrules(rules)
{:ok, ls, _} = rules
|> String.to_charlist()
|> :lexer.string()
CmdGraph.build_cmds(ls)
```

